<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Exposure to External Factors:</strong> Open trailers expose your vehicles to various external factors like weather conditions, road debris, and other unavoidable circumstances that can cause scratches, dents, or other damages.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Vehicle Condition:</strong> Since open trailers expose vehicles to the elements, your cars may arrive with visible signs of wear and tear, such as scratches, dents, or other damages.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Additional Safety Risks:</strong> Open trailers carry multiple vehicles side-by-side, increasing the risk of collisions or damages that could befall your vehicle during transportation.</span></li>
</ul>

<p>In Mahnar Bazar, it is recommended to opt for enclosed containerized carriers for vehicles, particularly for luxury and high-end cars, sports cars, or classic cars.</p>

