    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">To ensure the authenticity of the document, it is recommended that you have it self-attested. This involves getting it signed by a person who is authorized to attest documents, such as a government official or a notary.</p>
